  "conclusion": "Recorded tractor-router RSSI stayed at or above -72 dBm in active auto/manual rows, but the logger has no router-reading timestamp or age and carries the last received value forward. The CSVs therefore cannot prove uninterrupted Wi-Fi connectivity.",
